"iekļauts starptautisks prefikss (piemēram, +358).\n"
"\n"
"Ja tas ir atstāts tukšs, sistēma mēģina to automātiski noteikt no SIM kartes "
"vai tīkla.\n"
"\n"
"Šeit varat to manuāli ignorēt, ievadot 2 burtu ISO reģiona kodu (piem., ASV, "
"FI, DE) vai zvanīšanas kodu (piemēram, +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:332
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
